1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,420
Eat too fast and your belly balloons.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,849
Same lunch, no balloon.

3
00:00:03,889 --> 00:00:04,829
Want to know how?

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:09,020
Rewind! Five minutes ago,
lunch came down in huge gulps.

5
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,754
He swallowed so fast, air came down too!

6
00:00:11,933 --> 00:00:13,391
I'm stretched tight!

7
00:00:13,431 --> 00:00:15,353
Brain, we're full down here!

8
00:00:15,533 --> 00:00:16,909
The brain hasn't heard yet.

9
00:00:16,949 --> 00:00:18,320
He's reaching for more!

10
00:00:20,167 --> 00:00:21,764
Ugh. I'm bloated...

11
00:00:21,804 --> 00:00:23,020
and still hungry?!

12
00:00:23,467 --> 00:00:26,087
Doctor, why am I bloated and still hungry?

13
00:00:26,267 --> 00:00:28,410
Eat too fast and you swallow air.

14
00:00:28,450 --> 00:00:30,187
That means burps and bloating.

15
00:00:30,367 --> 00:00:33,055
But here's the twist:
your stomach was full.

16
00:00:33,095 --> 00:00:34,920
Your brain just didn't know yet.

17
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:36,320
My brain was late?

18
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:39,426
It can take fifteen minutes
or more to notice you're full.

19
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:42,648
So: same lunch, fifteen
minutes, no balloon.

20
00:00:42,688 --> 00:00:44,253
Chew well, fork down.

21
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,274
Small bites, slowly.

22
00:00:46,314 --> 00:00:48,620
No air, and full right on time!

23
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:49,712
Eat too fast?

24
00:00:49,752 --> 00:00:50,513
Not this belly.

25
00:00:50,553 --> 00:00:51,453
Never again!
